  "contentMarkdown": "## “Pelle” Certificate\n\n{{image:1}}\nThis version of leather product comes with a first grade leather, a tannery from Toscany (Italy) that respects the [Consortium Manifesto](notion:4a58a7b015244c8ea0d583c45532c0d3). It’s proof of quality, and respect for nature.\n\n{{image:2}}\n{{image:3}}\n{{image:4}}\n{{image:5}}\n{{image:6}}\n{{image:7}}\n{{image:8}}\n{{image:9}}\n{{image:10}}\n{{image:11}}\n{{image:12}}\n{{image:13}}\n{{image:14}}\n{{image:15}}\n{{image:16}}\n{{image:17}}\n{{image:18}}\n{{image:19}}\n{{image:20}}\n{{image:21}}\n{{image:22}}\n{{image:23}}",
